      "message": "nit: what does \"mode is protected\" mean? It is the page table that is protected?\n\nWhat\u0027s wrong with the simple wording I suggested, i.e. \"legacy mode page table is protected by pkvm\" (which is similar to the existing \"legacy mode page table is not present\" above)?",
